    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the draft. it's a good start, but i just ran it through our sentiment tool and the score is actually pretty low—it's coming back as very \"neutral\" and \"informative,\" which isn't what we want. we need it to feel much more emotionally resonant to get people to actually open their wallets.\n\ncould you try another version? try to dial up the emotional weight. i'm serious though, don't make it sound like a cheap soap opera or anything, just make it feel more hopeful and urgent so that sentiment score actually reflects the gravity of what's happening.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
