      "content": "okay, that's a bit better. the sentiment score went up, but it's still not quite where the board wants it to be for an emergency appeal. it feels like it's hitting the notes, but maybe it needs more of that \"positive emotional impact\" to really trip the sensor.\n\ncan you give it one more pass? try to really lean into the inspiring and hopeful side of the restoration. just please, i'm telling you again, don't go overboard with the adjectives or make it sound like a commercial. keep it professional and real, but we really need that sentiment score to climb so we can get this approved.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
